<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A3.F28.sf1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(a)</span> </span><span id="A3.F28.sf1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Subtype prompt for Solidarity (Step 2a).</span></figcaption>
